hw:SC_BASE a hw:Scenario ; rdfs:label "평일 기본"@ko, "Weekday base"@en .
hw:SC_INCIDENT a hw:Scenario ; rdfs:label "사고: 경부선 천안→청주 2차로 차단"@ko, "Crash: Gyeongbu Cheonan→Cheongju 2 lanes closed"@en ; hw:hasIncident hw:INC_INCIDENT .
hw:INC_INCIDENT a hw:Incident ; hw:affectsLink hw:S04F ; hw:startHour 16 ; hw:endHour 20 ; hw:lanesClosed 2 ; rdfs:comment "하행 4차로 중 2차로 16~20시 차단 (가상)"@ko .

